WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.028 --> 00:00:13.348
are you?"

2
00:00:13.689 --> 00:00:15.230
Gliss' mother screamed at Morb.

3
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.151
"How did you get past our shield?"

4
00:00:17.171 --> 00:00:18.493
"It's him!"

5
00:00:18.913 --> 00:00:19.553
Zann shouted.

6
00:00:19.573 --> 00:00:21.575
"The man we were telling you about!"

7
00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:23.376
Morb ignored him.

8
00:00:23.717 --> 00:00:27.240
"Freeze," he intoned, pointing at Gliss' parents.

9
00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.742
Instantly her parents froze in place.

10
00:00:30.462 --> 00:00:32.384
Her mother's eyes were wide and frightened.

11
00:00:33.172 --> 00:00:35.353
Her father's mouth was open in the middle of a shout.

12
00:00:36.393 --> 00:00:37.854
"Mom! Dad!"

13
00:00:38.134 --> 00:00:38.774
Gliss shrieked.

14
00:00:39.735 --> 00:00:41.195
Morb made a beckoning motion.

15
00:00:41.896 --> 00:00:44.957
A second later two large, hideous trolls appeared!

16
00:00:44.977 --> 00:00:48.879
"Take them to the dungeon," Morb ordered the trolls.

17
00:00:49.999 --> 00:00:54.321
Another quick flash and the trolls disappeared—along with Gliss' parents.

18
00:00:54.341 --> 00:00:56.942
"No!" Gliss screamed.

19
00:00:57.642 --> 00:00:58.943
"We have to get out of here!"

20
00:00:59.323 --> 00:00:59.963
Zann shouted.

21
00:01:00.623 --> 00:01:01.684
He rubbed his hands together.

22
00:01:02.712 --> 00:01:04.273
Perda was already doing the same.

23
00:01:04.914 --> 00:01:05.655
But not Gliss.

24
00:01:05.995 --> 00:01:06.936
She just stood there.

25
00:01:06.956 --> 00:01:09.438
"She's in shock," Zann said.

26
00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:13.061
"Even if we get away There was no time to say more.

27
00:01:13.401 --> 00:01:14.882
Morb had turned toward them.

28
00:01:15.563 --> 00:01:17.364
He glanced at Perda with disinterest.

29
00:01:18.105 --> 00:01:20.227
But when he saw Gliss, he smirked.

30
00:01:20.247 --> 00:01:23.730
"Another Red," he said, raising his hand.

31
00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.851
"No!" Darb cried.

32
00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:30.876
He reached into his pocket and flung a handful of panic bugs into Morb's face.

33
00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:37.482
"Ugh!" Morb exclaimed as the little insects panicked, releasing their foul-smelling odor.

34
00:01:37.502 --> 00:01:40.603
"Get away from me, you repulsive creatures!"

35
00:01:41.383 --> 00:01:44.924
It only took Morb a few seconds to blast the bugs to smithereens.

36
00:01:45.604 --> 00:01:46.644
But that was enough time.

37
00:01:46.664 --> 00:01:47.705
"Get her!"

38
00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:49.305
Zann shouted at Perda.

39
00:01:50.245 --> 00:01:51.166
Perda grabbed Gliss.

40
00:01:51.706 --> 00:01:53.286
Zap! They both disappeared.

41
00:01:54.086 --> 00:01:55.347
Zann dived for Darb.

42
00:01:55.987 --> 00:01:59.588
His hand closed on his friend's arm just as Morb spun toward them.

43
00:02:00.288 --> 00:02:01.569
The man's eyes narrowed.

44
00:02:01.589 --> 00:02:03.429
"Don't you dare!"

45
00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:04.430
he exclaimed.

46
00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:07.731
"This time you're not getting away from—" Zap!

47
00:02:09.212 --> 00:02:11.673
Splash! "Drat!"

48
00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:12.753
Zann cried.

49
00:02:12.773 --> 00:02:15.154
"How come I always land in the swamp?"

50
00:02:15.174 --> 00:02:17.956
"Forget that," Darb said breathlessly.

51
00:02:17.976 --> 00:02:19.596
"At least you got us out of there!"

52
00:02:20.417 --> 00:02:21.137
Zann nodded.

53
00:02:21.157 --> 00:02:23.438
"Good thinking using those panic bugs.

54
00:02:24.178 --> 00:02:25.759
You probably saved us all."

55
00:02:25.779 --> 00:02:28.220
"Thanks." Darb looked sad.

56
00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:30.508
"I wish he hadn't blasted them though."

57
00:02:31.269 --> 00:02:34.269
Zann wasn't going to waste time mourning a bunch of smelly insects.

58
00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.290
"We'd better find the girls."

59
00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.191
He waved a hand to summon a spy fly.

60
00:02:40.271 --> 00:02:42.812
Suddenly Morb materialized in front of them.

61
00:02:43.572 --> 00:02:44.952
"Stop right there!"

62
00:02:45.332 --> 00:02:45.893
he exclaimed.

63
00:02:45.913 --> 00:02:48.313
"What?" Zann cried, startled.

64
00:02:48.673 --> 00:02:51.074
"How did you—" He didn't bother to finish.

65
00:02:51.394 --> 00:02:53.515
Grabbing Darb, he zapped them away again.

66
00:02:54.275 --> 00:02:57.236
This time he aimed for the cave where Zing was waiting.

67
00:02:57.256 --> 00:02:59.633
"Whew!" he said when they landed.

68
00:02:59.653 --> 00:03:00.933
"That was close.

69
00:03:01.294 --> 00:03:05.356
How in the world did he—" Again Morb appeared.

70
00:03:05.376 --> 00:03:07.377
"Give up, Red!

71
00:03:07.637 --> 00:03:08.597
You can't escape!"

72
00:03:09.758 --> 00:03:12.259
Zann instantly grabbed both Darb and Zing.

73
00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.421
This time he didn't have time to think of a destination.

74
00:03:15.441 --> 00:03:20.684
"Ouch!" Darb exclaimed as they landed on a craggy boulder.

75
00:03:21.384 --> 00:03:22.785
"How's Morb doing this?"

76
00:03:23.205 --> 00:03:23.826
Zann cried.

77
00:03:24.526 --> 00:03:27.868
"He can't follow us through a Zap unless we leave him a trail!"

78
00:03:28.544 --> 00:03:29.584
Darb didn't answer.

79
00:03:30.245 --> 00:03:32.925
He just grabbed Zann as Morb appeared again.

80
00:03:32.945 --> 00:03:35.246
Morb cackled.

81
00:03:35.346 --> 00:03:39.307
"I told you, it's no use trying to escape.

82
00:03:40.067 --> 00:03:43.228
My magic is far superior to—" Zap!

83
00:03:46.089 --> 00:03:51.110
Darb yanked on Zann's arm as they landed near a stream where they'd often fished for moon minnows.

84
00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.071
"Come with me," he urged.

85
00:03:53.091 --> 00:03:56.732
"What?" Zann was rubbing his hands, preparing to zap again.

86
00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:01.162
He hoped his magical energy held out until he could figure out what to do.

87
00:04:01.182 --> 00:04:02.822
"Come on!"

88
00:04:03.122 --> 00:04:05.984
Darb took off running, with Zing flying behind him.

89
00:04:06.004 --> 00:04:07.844
"Darb! Wait!"

90
00:04:08.305 --> 00:04:09.365
Zann chased after them.

91
00:04:09.385 --> 00:04:12.406
"You'll never escape that guy without magic!"

92
00:04:13.127 --> 00:04:14.147
Darb didn't answer.

93
00:04:14.447 --> 00:04:16.488
He dove into a thick clump of bushes.

94
00:04:17.308 --> 00:04:18.049
Zann followed.

95
00:04:19.689 --> 00:04:20.570
"What are you doing?"

96
00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:25.932
"Hush!" Darb crawled forward, peering out from among the dense branches.

97
00:04:26.992 --> 00:04:29.754
Morb soon appeared in the spot where the boys had landed.

98
00:04:29.774 --> 00:04:33.056
"This game is becoming tiresome."

99
00:04:33.397 --> 00:04:34.317
He glanced around.

100
00:04:34.337 --> 00:04:36.339
"You might as well give up.

101
00:04:37.099 --> 00:04:40.742
Trust me, you do not want to anger me further."

102
00:04:40.762 --> 00:04:44.684
"Quick, let's zap away again before he—" Zann hissed.

103
00:04:44.704 --> 00:04:47.086
"No!" Darb cut him off.

104
00:04:47.106 --> 00:04:48.527
"Don't you get it?

105
00:04:48.787 --> 00:04:50.628
He's tracking your magic somehow."

106
00:04:51.509 --> 00:04:52.509
Could Darb be right?

107
00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.952
Zann had never heard of someone tracking people through their magic.

108
00:04:56.992 --> 00:04:57.852
Then he remembered.

109
00:04:57.872 --> 00:05:00.954
"I think we studied that last year," he said.

110
00:05:00.974 --> 00:05:04.875
"But that kind of magic has been banned since the Old Times."

111
00:05:04.895 --> 00:05:08.417
"Flash Freezes are illegal too," Darb reminded him.

112
00:05:08.437 --> 00:05:10.598
"And Morb has been using them."

113
00:05:11.818 --> 00:05:12.959
"So what can we do?"

114
00:05:13.439 --> 00:05:14.479
Zann felt helpless.

115
00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:19.301
If Morb could find him every time he used magic, there was no escape.

116
00:05:19.321 --> 00:05:21.802
"Let's get to the Hollow," Darb said.

117
00:05:21.822 --> 00:05:24.143
"His magic can't find us there.

118
00:05:24.443 --> 00:05:25.584
It'll give us time to think."

119
00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:26.980
Zann gulped.

120
00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:27.860
The Hollow?

121
00:05:28.141 --> 00:05:29.921
He would feel even more helpless there!

122
00:05:30.561 --> 00:05:31.501
But Darb was right.

123
00:05:31.722 --> 00:05:35.523
They had to get away from Morb long enough to figure out what was going on.

124
00:05:35.543 --> 00:05:39.023
"Okay." Zann sneaked another peek at Morb.

125
00:05:40.044 --> 00:05:43.905
"But first I've got to use magic once more to let Perda know what's happening."

126
00:05:44.825 --> 00:05:45.905
Darb looked worried.

127
00:05:46.285 --> 00:05:48.926
"Morb will know where you are as soon as you summon the moth.

128
00:05:49.666 --> 00:05:51.507
You won't have time to inscribe the message."

129
00:05:52.347 --> 00:05:53.167
Zann bit his lip.

130
00:05:53.187 --> 00:05:54.067
"Good point."

131
00:05:54.928 --> 00:05:55.728
Darb smiled.

132
00:05:56.124 --> 00:06:00.526
"Then again I just happen to know that message moths like to rest in shady underbrush.

133
00:06:01.286 --> 00:06:07.529
So if we can find one without using magic He carefully crawled around, peering under leaves.

134
00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:13.371
Seconds later he cupped his hands around a fluttering insect.

135
00:06:13.391 --> 00:06:16.052
"Awesome!" Zann whispered.

136
00:06:16.692 --> 00:06:22.315
Grabbing the moth, he quickly inscribed his message onto its wings: Don't use ANY magic!

137
00:06:22.795 --> 00:06:23.835
Meet at the Hollow.

138
00:06:24.695 --> 00:06:25.756
Darb was peering out.

139
00:06:26.092 --> 00:06:27.874
"He's getting closer," he whispered.

140
00:06:28.475 --> 00:06:29.256
"Better do it now."

141
00:06:29.276 --> 00:06:31.758
"Perda," Zann told the moth.

142
00:06:32.419 --> 00:06:34.781
He rubbed his fingers together and released the creature.

143
00:06:34.801 --> 00:06:40.788
"Aha!" Morb howled triumphantly from very close by.

144
00:06:40.808 --> 00:06:45.893
"Zap!" Zann yelled, focusing on the spot right outside the Hollow.
